  "error: A coefficient freed across groups refers to a removed path.",
  "error: A mean freed across groups refers to a construct without a mean arrow.",
  "warning: Coefficients are freed across groups, but the structural coefficients are not held equal (Groups): the freeing has no effect.",
  "error: "Alpha" is in an ESEM block, whose loadings are rotated: remove its fixed loadings and loading labels. [#0]",
