  "error: Wald test “w”: q is not a label or defined parameter.",
  "error: Moderated moderation (a moderator acting on a moderation) is available in PLS-SEM and conditional process analysis.",
  "warning: Disturbances of Alpha and Beta covary while one predicts the other: the model is non-recursive and usually not identified unless both have instruments (predictors the other lacks). [#0]",
  "error: Epsilon and  are fixed as uncorrelated, which applies to two exogenous constructs only. Delete the fixed zero. [#4]",
  "error: Correlation  ↔ Delta joins an exogenous construct with an endogenous one. Correlate exogenous constructs with each other, or the disturbances of endogenous constructs. [#7]",
  "error: Error correlation b1 ↔ d1: single-indicator constructs have no measurement error to correlate. [#3]",
  "warning: Disturbances of phi and Beta covary while one predicts the other: the model is non-recursive and usually not identified unless both have instruments (predictors the other lacks). [#5]",
  "warning: Non-recursive model (phi → Alpha closes a loop). Each construct in a loop needs a predictor the other lacks (an instrument) or the loop is not identified; lavaan reports the identification problem if so.",
]
`;

