  "error: The direct effect  → a2 on an indicator is a CB-SEM parameter; switch to CB-SEM or remove it.",
  "error: "Alpha": its pre-defined weights are all zero. [#0]",
  "error: Phi moderating Alpha → Beta uses orthogonalising: that interaction term is seminr’s (interaction_term). Choose seminr under R packages, or the two-stage term. [#6]",
  "error: A moderation refers to a path that no longer exists.",
  "error: The constant (means and intercepts) is a CB-SEM feature: switch to CB-SEM, or remove the triangle.",
  "error: The categorical variable "" must be a single column (its categories become dummy variables). [#7]",
  "warning: PLS-SEM treats the ordinal indicators (k1, k2) as continuous.",
  "warning: Weighted PLS (sampling weights wt) is estimated by the built-in engine: neither cSEM nor seminr takes sampling weights.",
